  "question": {
    "text": "Locus of the mid-points of the chords of contact of&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> from the points on the line <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math> is a circle with centre <math><mi>C</mi></math>. If <math><mi></mi><mi>O</mi></math> be the origin, then <math><mi></mi><mi></mi><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to"
  },
